  "description": "Washed-up fighter Lee Jung-Woo lost everything when an injury ended his career, and now he’s buried under a mountain of debt. Whenever the trauma comes crashing back, he escapes into one-night stands with strangers...anything to avoid facing reality. Then one night, he runs straight into Seung-Jo, who is wounded, hunted, and on the verge of collapse. When the stranger passes out, Jung-Woo brings him home to nurse him back to health. Some fights, it turns out, follow you home. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: The third story in CNC Revolution's XXL Danpyeonseon (XXL 단편선) Collection.*",
